  "summary": "Migrate the wall-media family (TV_42/TV_55/TV_65 and the singular parametric VIDEO_WALL_2X2/VIDEO_WALL_3X3) into the canonical Item Contract. src/items.js WALL_MEDIA_ITEMS becomes the single source-of-truth; catalog descriptors, the tv state factory and TV_42_DIMENSIONS now derive from getItem/resolveWallMediaMetrics; project load hydrates catalogKey->itemKey. The tvConfig.js second business source-of-truth is removed. Wall-overlay height clamp now uses geometric top/bottom bounds after the shared 10 cm snap so every TV/video-wall screen size can sit flush to the wall edge (TV_55 no longer looks special). The same uncommitted working set also carries the plastic-trash-bin catalog-preview silhouette change in src/moduleDragSidebar.js, so this contract governs those surfaces together.",
